Package: logconNMF
Type: Package
Title: Log-Concave Nonnegative Matrix Factorization with Automatic Rank Selection
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Date: 2026-11-01
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tom", "Wenseleers", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "tom.wenseleers@kuleuven.be"),
    person("Christophe", "Vanderaa", role = "aut",
           email = "christophe.vanderaa@kuleuven.be"))
Description: Separates overlapping ordered signals into nonnegative
    log-concave profiles and channel loadings, with automatic rank selection,
    optional smooth backgrounds and flexible noise models. Estimates constant
    or time-varying point spread functions and fits simultaneous models that share
    loadings across samples on their original observation grids.
